@startuml task_read_counters
!pragma layout smetana
title 类型任务: read_counters / folder_projection
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

database "记录的事件 outbox\nfanout/read/hide/move/delete" as OUTBOX
participant "任务投影器" as PROJECTOR
database "Immutable tasks\n1 在 outbox event/scope" as TASKS
database "租 exact scope key\nlease + fencing" as CLAIM
participant "工人机" as WORKER
database "信息的真相 + read_at\n访问 + 政策" as SOURCE
database "活动 USER_STREAM_BINDING\n+ STREAM.is_archived/private" as STREAM_SOURCE
database "FOLDER + normalized FOLDER_ITEM\nsource of truth" as FOLDERS
database "USER_STREAM_BINDING" as STREAM_BINDING
database "USER_TOPIC_BINDING" as TOPIC_BINDING
database "USER_FOLDER_BINDING" as FOLDER_BINDING
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENTS
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISPATCHER
actor "客户端" as Client

OUTBOX -> PROJECTOR : 已记录的影响事件
PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable folder_projection 文件\nuser-folder scope; unique derivation; 没有 coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : 明显受影响的区域
WORKER -> CLAIM : 独占的 user-stream / user-topic / user-folder
WORKER -> SOURCE : 读取最后的初始状态
WORKER -> STREAM_SOURCE : 阅读一个主动的绑定 + 规范 STREAM
WORKER -> STREAM_BINDING : 电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池电池
WORKER -> TOPIC_BINDING : 我们的主题是有能力的
group 一个 worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> FOLDERS : 我们可以添加/删除 automatic FOLDER_ITEM
  WORKER -> FOLDER_BINDING : deterministic folder_items_snapshot + counts\nversion/snapshot_updated_at; empty=[]
  WORKER -> EVENTS : ready stream.updated / topic.updated / folder.updated\n其他 folder_item.deleted, 宣布时 contract operation\nunique derivation/effect key
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : 释放
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : 只有在 commit: 稳定的记录
DISPATCHER -> Client : 发送 / 重复 / 播放

note over SOURCE,FOLDER_BINDING
  容器组件不存储在绑定/消息状态.
  USER_FOLDER_BINDING 保存访问权限,个人状态
  及已成型的机组 + read-only folder_items_snapshot.
  Public folder_items 显示的确 snapshot; empty=[].
  API 阅读一个 indexed row/page, 没有 N+1/json_agg/COUNT/custom SQL.
  修改/重组仅在背景下执行.
  Topic-worker 没有写这些 shared rows.
  Atomic delta 要求 exactly-once effect guard 根据 outbox_event_uuid;
  否则 scope worker recomputes/writes.
  Lifecycle: lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper.
end note

note over STREAM_SOURCE,FOLDERS
  预言: 活跃的 USER_STREAM_BINDING + STREAM.is_archived=false.
  All chats = 所有这些行.
  Personal = 只有 STREAM.private=true.
  Channels = 只有 STREAM.private=false.
  客户端请求无法计算这个组合.
  Stable order: pinned_at DESC first; then
  order_index ASC NULLS LAST, created_at ASC, uuid ASC.
  No silent truncation; exact count/byte hard limits remain required.
end note

@enduml
